          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That's really hard, but I'm sure we can find a way to make your sleeping more at ease. Has it been happening frequently? ",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p18",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
